data: {"id": "eb564c1b616443c4-thinking-layer-1080", "run_id": "eb564c1b616443c4", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_token", "tool_name": null, "content": "\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789123907997}

event: thinking
data: {"id": "eb564c1b616443c4-thinking-layer-1081", "run_id": "eb564c1b616443c4", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "`workload` Pod 所在的 `aiops-case-v05` 命名空间下没有 PVC，因此排除了 PVC 绑定失败导致的 `ContainerCreating`。\n\n`ContainerCreating` 状态持续 35 分钟，最可能的原因是**镜像拉取（ImagePull）**或**沙箱/网络（Sandbox/CNI）**问题。\n\n由于 `kubectl get` 工具无法直接显示详细事件（Events），我将获取相关的 Runbook 以指导后续的证据采集（在 Evidence 节点执行）。针对 `ContainerCreating`，最相关的 Runbook 是 `pod-imagepull-failed.md` 和 `pod-sandbox-create-failed.md`。\n\n我将先获取 `pod-imagepull-failed.md`，因为镜像拉取失败是导致 `ContainerCreating` 非常常见的原因。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789123908490}

