event: thinking
data: {"id": "eb564c1b616443c4-thinking-parallel_evidence-2297", "run_id": "eb564c1b616443c4", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "关键事实已齐全：\n\n1. **ConfigMap workload-input 存在**，但其中只包含 `available-key: present`\n2. **Pod 的 Volume 挂载引用了不存在的 key**：事件原文为 `configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key`\n3. **Pod 处于 Pending 阶段**，因为 VolumeMount 持续失败，容器从未启动\n4. **日志和 Trace 为空**：这是预期结果——容器从未启动过，不会有应用日志或 L7 流量\n5. **Prometheus 指标确认**：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1`，reason 为 `ContainerCreating`，restarts=0\n6. **无 imagePullSecrets**、没有 RuntimeClass、CNI 无问题（Pod 成功调度到 node2）\n\n## 已采集事实总结\n\n| 维度 | 事实 |\n|------|------|\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789123964720, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

